@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Success";
}

<h1>Congratulations!</h1>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h3>You did the thing!</h3>
        <p>
            Congratulations! 🎉 You've taken the first step towards liberating yourself from the shackles of student loan debt. By subscribing to the Student Debt Collective, you're joining a powerful movement that's committed to ending the burden of student loans for countless individuals just like you.
        </p>
        <p>
            <b>Please be sure to check the email you signed up with to make sure we didn't end up in your Junk/Spam folder!</b>
        </p>
        <h3>
            Together, We Can Make a Difference
        </h3>
        <p>
            Every subscription matters. With your $5 monthly contribution, you're not just subscribing to a newsletter – you're investing in a collective effort to create lasting change. Imagine the impact of all of us coming together to chip away at student loan debt, month after month.
        </p>
        <h3>
            A Community of Change Makers
        </h3>
        <p>
            You're now a valued member of a community that believes in financial freedom and education accessibility. Our monthly newsletters will keep you informed about our progress, success stories, and the impact of your contributions. We're in this journey together, and your commitment makes a real difference.
        </p>
        <h3>
            A Path to Debt Freedom
        </h3>
        <p>
            Remember, every subscriber has a chance to be selected for a lump sum payment towards their student loan debt. The more we grow, the bigger the impact we can make on someone's financial future. Your subscription isn't just about the newsletter; it's about creating tangible change in people's lives.
        </p>

        <h3>
            Stay Connected
        </h3>
        <p>
            Keep an eye on your inbox for our monthly newsletters. We'll share updates, stories of triumph, and the inspiring journey of each debt liberation. Be sure to follow us on social media too, where our community thrives. Spread the word and let others know that together, we're changing lives.
        </p>
        <h3>
            Thank You for Joining
        </h3>
        <p>
            Thank you for believing in the power of collective action. Your subscription signifies hope, unity, and progress. Together, we can pave the way for a brighter, debt-free future.
        </p>

        <p>
            Welcome to the movement, and thank you for being a force of positive change!
        </p>
    </div>
</div>